# UI Files — Cursor Rules

- Always use `AppColors.*` — never `Color(0xFF...)`
- Always use `AppTextStyles.*` — never `TextStyle(fontSize: ...)`
- Always use `AppDimensions.*` — never magic numbers like `16.0`
- Always use `AppAnimations.*` durations and curves
- Cards use `AppColors.surface`, `AppDimensions.radiusLg`, `elevation: 0`
- One primary CTA per screen (`AppColors.primary` background)
- Screens receive data as constructor parameters — no game logic in screen files

Full reference: `DESIGN_SYSTEM.md`
